~0.5
ffvPassenger assignAsCargo ffvJeep
ffvPassenger moveInCargo ffvJeep
ffvPassenger selectWeapon "M16"
ffvShots=0
ffvPassenger addEventHandler ["Fired",{ffvShots=ffvShots+1}]
~2
hint "Jeep: use the action menu to Ready personal weapon (Waffe im Fahrzeug bereitmachen). Aim RIGHT, left mouse fires, R reloads. Stow personal weapon returns to the normal seat."
exit
